            "text": "Tool tier gate bypass / BFLA — Tier 3 HITL enforcement — Ruled out: ToolRegistry.executeTool tier gate (lib/domain/tools/chat/tool_registry.dart:238-258) + agent_cubit ReAct loop\n\nUnchanged conclusion, now independently corroborated by two other agents. Tier-3 HITL enforcement holds: the gate is a local-const equality test (agent_cubit.dart:753/760-765) with no early return or batch path that skips it; `_processPendingToolCalls` runs sequentially and returns on the first Tier-3 call. The gateway path fails closed when no approval callback is wired (gateway_rpc_receiver.dart:91-104), and the voice path returns VoiceTurnNeedsApprovalFailure rather than auto-approving (chat_voice_prompt_dispatcher.dart:125-127). The approval modal renders the real `request.parameters` and the same map object is executed — no TOCTOU (action_approval_sheet.dart:44-45 vs agent_cubit.dart:611-614). Confirmed independently by the Tier-2 Gate agent (coverage d7ea13/c8730f family) and the Skill/Tool-Result agent."
