          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Tier-3 HITL bypass via the gateway RPC path (id replay / missing callback) — Ruled out: GatewayDeviceRpcReceiver + GatewayRpcCubit approval flow\n\ngateway_rpc_receiver.dart:89-143 gates Tier 3 before executing; when no approval callback is wired the handler FAILS CLOSED (returns an error frame at :91-104). The callback is injected per-call at gateway_rpc_cubit.dart:138 and the modal binds to `rpcState.request.id`, the same id whose Completer is completed — so the user approves exactly the request displayed (no id-replay mismatch). Two hardening items, neither a bypass: `_requestHitlApproval` (gateway_rpc_cubit.dart:159-166) has no timeout, so a duplicate server-chosen id leaks the first Completer and that handler awaits forever; and ActionApprovalSheet is `isDismissible:false, enableDrag:false` (action_approval_sheet.dart:31-32), so an unanswered prompt blocks the chat UI. Per the threat model the gateway is trusted infrastructure, so these are availability/robustness observations, not authorization failures."
