            "text": "SQL injection via FTS5 MATCH query building — Ruled out: lib/data/datasources/local/memory/sqlite_memory_datasource.dart (memory vault FTS5)\n\nLocalMemoryService / SqliteMemoryDatasource build the FTS5 MATCH query as a parameter, not by interpolation: sqlite_memory_datasource.dart:290-300 uses 'WHERE memories_fts MATCH ?' with whereArgs [sanitizedMatchQuery, limit]; the query is first reduced to word characters by _extractWords (:445-454, regex strips non-word chars) and _sanitizeFtsQuery (:456-461) emits only 'word* OR word*'. All other statements use where/whereArgs binding (e.g. :210-215, :228-237, :346-350). LIKE fallback also parameterized (:324-340). No injection sink found. Note: whether stored memory content is treated as trusted when replayed into the prompt is a SEPARATE candidate under review by another agent (memory → role:system injection) — not closed by this entry."
