          "message": {
            "text": "Skill tool-disable policy bypass via tool_search/tool_describe re-discovery — Ruled out: Tool discovery + enablement path (agent_cubit.dart:800-816, 892-905; tool_registry.dart:246-248)\n\nagent_cubit.dart:896-905 re-adds tools discovered via `tool_search`/`tool_describe` to the model's tool list, but line 897 `if (!_toolRegistry.isToolEnabled(name)) continue;` re-checks the enabled state before each re-add. Combined with executeTool's own `if (!isToolEnabled(name)) return Left(...)` at tool_registry.dart:246-248, a skill-disabled tool cannot be re-enabled or executed through the discovery meta-tools. The `tool_search` result parser (:800-816) also only records names that exist in the registry."
