            "text": "Autonomous/scheduled action execution bypassing the HITL approval gate — Ruled out: Action Center (lib/domain/services/action_center/, lib/presentation/screen/action_center/, lib/data/datasources/local/action_center/)\n\nNamed controls: (a) ActionCenterCubit.executeAction (lib/presentation/screen/action_center/cubit/action_center_cubit.dart:63-72) only calls markAsRead and sets lastExecutedActionId — it performs no tool invocation, navigation, or platform call; (b) the payload's only consumed field is a display label (lib/presentation/screen/action_center/widgets/action_item_card.dart:62-63), and an `open_settings` key is explicitly treated as an inert navigation marker (:65, :69-71); (c) the sole producers are the local battery reader and local geofence engine (ambient_trigger_service.dart:216-349) — no gateway frame, model tool call, or notification can create an item, and grep shows no other ActionItem construction site. Nothing here crosses the HITL boundary because no action executes at all. The ambient WorkManager callback (ambient_trigger_service.dart:16-19) returns true without performing work, and no receiver is declared for RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED (AndroidManifest.xml:10 only requests the permission), so nothing runs at boot."
