            "text": "Intent redirection, exported-component abuse — Ruled out: RationaleActivity (exported, no permission) — intent redirection / privileged action trampoline\n\nRationaleActivity.kt:7-17 has no attacker-controlled input path: onCreate takes no extras, reads no data URI, and the only action it performs is startActivity(Intent(\"androidx.health.ACTION_HEALTH_CONNECT_SETTINGS\")) with a hardcoded action, then finish(). It cannot be used as an intent-redirect trampoline because it never forwards a caller-supplied Intent, component name, or extras — the outgoing intent is fully literal, and any caller-injected extras on the incoming intent are never read or re-attached. No state is leaked (no output, no result, no logging)."
