            "text": "Credential exposure or third-party control of the background service — Ruled out: android/app/src/main/kotlin/ai/hermes/flames/FlamesBackgroundService.kt\n\nNamed control: FlamesBackgroundService is android:exported=\"false\" (AndroidManifest.xml:157-164), so the ACTION_VOICE_INPUT / ACTION_CANCEL_VOICE / ACTION_QUICK_STATUS actions it handles (FlamesBackgroundService.kt:216-259) cannot be delivered by a third-party app. It holds no credentials: the only cross-process state is the MethodChannel reference (dartChannel, :140-153), and the wake lock (:103-134) plus notification text are non-secret. This is distinct from the MainActivity-supplied action extra, which is covered by its own entry. Note for completeness: the only app-internal starter is the gateway keepalive policy (gateway_link_cubit.dart:85-103), which starts the service while the socket is live."
