        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/audio-transcript-handling-remote-stt-endpoint-and-voice-driven-tier-3-tool-execution-bypassing-hitl",
          "ruleIndex": 60,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Audio/transcript handling, remote STT endpoint, and voice-driven tier-3 tool execution bypassing HITL — Ruled out: Voice pipeline (lib/data/services/voice/, lib/presentation/voice/, lib/domain/services/voice/)\n\nNamed controls on every hop: (a) recognition is the platform speech_to_text plugin (lib/data/datasources/tools/chat/voice_input_service.dart:33-81, 202-208) — no audio buffer or temp file is created by app code and no audio is uploaded to a project-owned STT endpoint; (b) the transcript is not concatenated into a system prompt — it is dispatched as a normal user message (voice_turn_service.dart:192 dispatcher.dispatch(transcript) -> chat_voice_prompt_dispatcher.dart:114 cubit.sendMessage(trimmed)), so it carries no more authority than typed text and is subject to the same tier gate at tool_registry.dart:238-262; (c) the HITL gate is not bypassed by voice: a tier-3 tool pauses the turn and the dispatcher returns VoiceTurnNeedsApprovalFailure (chat_voice_prompt_dispatcher.dart:125-127) without approving anything — approveAction is reachable only from the user's sheet tap (chat_screen.dart:1577-1585, :2010); (d) the turn is single-flight (voice_turn_service.dart:76-79 _active, :94-99 isListening check). Residual, recorded as its own row: the intent-supplied action extra can start such a turn with no tap."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Voice pipeline (lib/data/services/voice/, lib/presentation/voice/, lib/domain/services/voice/)"
