        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/prompt-injection-security-control-that-does-not-gate-advisory-only-scanner-cannot-block-import-of-an-injection-payload",
          "ruleIndex": 63,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Prompt injection / security-control that does not gate — advisory-only scanner cannot block import of an injection payload — Ruled out: Remote skill import pipeline: SkillSecurityScanner.scan → SkillImportPreview.canImport → SkillImportService.confirmImport (lib/domain/services/skills/skill_security_scanner.dart:149-190, lib/domain/entities/skills/skill_scan.dart:41-57, lib/domain/entities/skills/skill_import_preview.dart:20-21, lib/domain/services/skills/skill_import_service.dart:59-75)\n\nRESOLVED from needs_follow_up to ruled_out as a vulnerability. Named controls, all user-consent gates verified at file:line: (1) exactly one import entry point — `skills_hub_screen.dart:131` opens `SkillImportDialog`; the user must supply the URL and tap Fetch (`skill_import_dialog.dart:108`), and `registerSkillFromMarkdown`/`registerSkill` (`skills_cubit.dart:113-120`) have NO production caller at all; (2) the preview warns before import — findings rendered as 'Possible injection patterns (advisory): <patternIds>' in amber (`skill_import_dialog.dart:194-195`, :202) with Import as a separate deliberate tap (`:216`); (3) `applyImportPolicy` forces `isEnabled: false` (`skill_security_scanner.dart:189-190`); (4) enabling requires the explicit hub toggle (`skills_hub_screen.dart:313-327` → `setSkillEnabled` `skills_registry_service.dart:249-257`) and the persisted `skill_states` row is written with the already-false value (`:213`), so hydration (`:163-170`) cannot resurrect it; (5) a remote skill cannot register new tools (`DocBuilderSkill.registerTools` is DI-bootstrap-only, `injection.config.dart:391-393`); (6) the skill `tools` list grants nothing new because every tool defaults to enabled (`tool_registry.dart:210`, :222). RESIDUAL HARDENING OBSERVATION (not a finding): the scanner cannot block a payload (`scan()` :149-185 only builds `unknownTools`; `isRejected => hasUnknownTools` at `skill_scan.dart:47`), `isClean` (:50) is therefore true for a skill with critical findings and is currently test-only (no production caller), and `buildSystemPrompt` (`skills_registry_service.dart:362-379`) concatenates skill text into the system prompt with no untrusted-data delimiter. Static-only: no emulator, no Dart toolchain, so nothing was executed."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Remote skill import pipeline: SkillSecurityScanner.scan → SkillImportPreview.canImport → SkillImportService.confirmImport (lib/domain/services/skills/skill_security_scanner.dart:149-190, lib/domain/entities/skills/skill_scan.dart:41-57, lib/domain/entities/skills/skill_import_preview.dart:20-21, lib/domain/services/skills/skill_import_service.dart:59-75)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "strix": {
              "coverage_outcome": "ruled_out",
              "risk_area": "Prompt injection / security-control that does not gate — advisory-only scanner cannot block import of an injection payload",
              "surface": "Remote skill import pipeline: SkillSecurityScanner.scan → SkillImportPreview.canImport → SkillImportService.confirmImport (lib/domain/services/skills/skill_security_scanner.dart:149-190, lib/domain/entities/skills/skill_scan.dart:41-57, lib/domain/entities/skills/skill_import_preview.dart:20-21, lib/domain/services/skills/skill_import_service.dart:59-75)",
