            "text": "Alternative config-write path with weaker validation (intent/deep link/manual entry) — Ruled out: Exported MainActivity intent handling + Add-Profile manual entry\n\nExported `MainActivity` intent filters (`android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml:73-115`) surface only `extra_flames_action` and the quick-tile action; `MainActivity.extractActionFromIntent` (MainActivity.kt:73-85) maps them to fixed strings consumed by `VoiceTurnActionListener._handleAction` (`lib/presentation/voice/voice_turn_action_listener.dart:166-188`, cases `voice_input`/`cancel_voice`/`quick_status`). No intent extra reaches `saveBaseUrl`/`saveApiKey`, and no deep link or `app_links`/`uni_links` handler exists. The Add-Profile screen (`lib/presentation/screen/settings/add_profile_screen.dart:411-421`) only calls `addProfile` with user-typed fields, and the probe service (`server_profile_probe_service_impl.dart:23,70`) uses the same typed URL."
