        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/continuous-background-sensitive-data-collection-location-geofence",
          "ruleIndex": 70,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Continuous/background sensitive-data collection (location, geofence) — No issue identified: AmbientTriggerService geofence/battery background checks\n\nThe periodic background task registered by schedulePeriodicCheck does no collection: the Workmanager callback dispatcher is a no-op — `void ambientWorkmanagerCallbackDispatcher() { Workmanager().executeTask((taskName, inputData) async => true); }` (lib/data/datasources/tools/chat/ambient_trigger_service.dart:17-19) returns true without reading location, battery, or health. Geofence checks are pull-only via the agent tool: `checkAll` is called from exactly one non-service site, tool_registry.dart:1051 (the ambient check tool), and `checkGeofence` requires latitude/longitude to be supplied by the caller. `schedulePeriodicCheck` is invoked only from the Pocket Node UI screen (pocket_node_screen.dart:237), not automatically at app start. So there is no unattended continuous location or device-data collection."
          },
          "locations": [
