            "text": "HITL approval TOCTOU / benign-summary-vs-real-arguments bypass — Ruled out: Tier-3 HITL approval modal (action_approval_sheet.dart) + approveAction execution path\n\nlib/presentation/screen/chat/widgets/action_approval_sheet.dart:45 renders `const JsonEncoder.withIndent('  ').convert(request.parameters)` and :68 shows `request.name` — the approval UI displays the ACTUAL arguments. The same map object is passed through unchanged: agent_cubit.dart:754-758 builds ToolCallRequest with `parameters: arguments`, and approveAction (:606-614) executes `pending.parameters` with no mutation between approval and execution. No TOCTOU / summary-vs-executed mismatch on the Tier-3 path."
