          "message": {
            "text": "Remote gateway RPC invoking a Tier-3 device tool without HITL approval — Ruled out: GatewayDeviceRpcReceiver.handleRequest (lib/domain/services/gateway/gateway_rpc_receiver.dart:68-196)\n\nControl: gateway_rpc_receiver.dart:89-104 — when `onApprovalRequired` is null the handler returns an error frame ('requires user approval, but no approval handler was registered') and never reaches executeTool at :148. Wiring at modules.dart does not pass a callback, and GatewayRpcCubit injects one per-call at gateway_rpc_cubit.dart:138, so the remote path cannot invoke a Tier-3 tool headlessly. Recorded separately from the agent-loop gate because it is an independent entry point (the remote server, not the model, chooses the tool name and arguments)."
