            "text": "Secret exposure via world-readable / external storage locations — Ruled out: Storage path selection for SQLite (memory, skills, chat) and Hive\n\nNo path uses external/public storage: no getExternalStorageDirectory/getDownloadsDirectory/Environment or /sdcard references in lib/ or android/app/src/main/kotlin. All storage roots are app-private — sqflite getDatabasesPath() with a getApplicationDocumentsDirectory() fallback (sqlite_memory_datasource.dart:85-107, local_memory_service.dart:88-107, skills_local_datasource.dart:48-66, chat_local_datasource.dart:64-68) and Hive.initFlutter('flames') under the app documents dir (myapp.dart:47). Credentials only ever pass through flutter_secure_storage."
