              "surface": "nfc_read_tag (tool_registry.dart:1558-1602)",
              "recorded_by": "Tier-2 Permission Gate Bypass Validator",
              "source": "agent_reported"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/tier-2-gate-bypass-unauthorized-nfc-e-money-balance-read",
          "ruleIndex": 92,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Tier-2 gate bypass / unauthorized NFC e-money balance read — Ruled out: nfc_read_emoney_balance (tool_registry.dart:1605-1658)\n\nSame as `nfc_read_tag`: no runtime permission exists for NFC (install-time normal permission, no dialog), and `nfc_service.dart:280-291` `readEmoneyBalance` goes through `_platform.runWithCard` which requires a live foreground NFC session completed by the user physically tapping a card. The `execute` closure checks `isAvailable()`/`isEnabled()` first. Absent `checkPermission` skips no permission evaluation; the physical tap is the effective gate."
