        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/tier-1-misclassification-residual-instances-not-included-in-the-filed-fix-set",
          "ruleIndex": 94,
          "kind": "open",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Tier-1 misclassification (residual instances not included in the filed fix set) — Requires further review: Residual Tier-1 side-effecting tools: speak_text, open_map_navigation, list_device_files\n\nThree further Tier-1 tools have side effects but were deliberately excluded from the fix set in vuln-0005 as lower-impact: `speak_text` (tool_registry.dart:1119, tier :1138) speaks arbitrary model text aloud; `open_map_navigation` (:1442, tier :1462) launches an external app via a geo intent; `list_device_files` (:793, tier :809) performs ungated recursive directory enumeration (its file-read aspect is owned by another agent). Same root cause as the reported defect but not remediated by the six tier changes; flagged for follow-up rather than silently dropped."
          },
