        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/tier-2-gate-bypass-unauthorized-accessibility-screen-tree-read",
          "ruleIndex": 101,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Tier-2 gate bypass / unauthorized accessibility screen-tree read — Ruled out: ui_find_elements (tool_registry.dart:1715-1775)\n\nShape (a) documented intentional omission: `tool_registry.dart:1761-1763` carries the comment \"No checkPermission: the registry gate would return a generic PermissionFailure, while the service returns the actionable [accessibility_not_enabled] message the model needs.\" The service independently enforces status before reading: `accessibility_inspector_service.dart:109-112` returns a Left failure unless `checkStatus() == AccessibilityStatus.active`, and `checkStatus()` (:72-86) reads the platform service-connected/granted state. A non-enabled accessibility service therefore cannot be read."
          },
          "locations": [
