          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Imported skill enabled by default / missing signature gate — Ruled out: Skill import enablement and gating (skill_import_service.dart:59-75, skill_security_scanner.dart:187-190)\n\nEvery import passes `SkillSecurityScanner.applyImportPolicy` which forces `isEnabled: false, isCommunity: true` (skill_security_scanner.dart:189-190), applied in `SkillImportService.confirmImport` before `registerImportedSkill` (skill_import_service.dart:69-73). Frontmatter `is_enabled: true` is parsed at skills_registry_service.dart:70-71 but is overridden on the import path. The only paths that skip the policy — `SkillsCubit.registerSkillFromMarkdown` (skills_cubit.dart:113) and `SkillsCubit.registerSkill` (:119) — have NO production caller (grep shows only tests), so the shipped ingest path is exclusively importSkillFromUrl → buildPreview → confirmSkillImport. No signature/allowlist exists; the only hard gate is `unknownTools` (skill_scan.dart:82), scanner findings being advisory. Signature absence is a design characteristic, not an exploitable defect on its own."
          },
