            "text": "Archive extraction / Zip-Slip in any other pipeline (family sweep) — No issue identified: Whole-app sweep for archive-extraction and download-to-disk pipelines (lib/ + android/)\n\nSwept lib/ and android/ for every archive/compression/decompression API (`TarDecoder|ZipDecoder|BZip2Decoder|GZipCodec|ExtractFileToDisk|extractArchiveToDisk|ZipInputStream|GZIPInputStream|TarInputStream`): the ONLY extraction pipeline in the entire app is piper_tts_engine.dart:234-235. No other download-and-extract, unzip, or restore path exists, so no sibling instance of this bug class was missed. Other file writers are file_workspace_service.dart:74 (bytes supplied in-process), local_memory_service.dart / sqlite_memory_datasource.dart (SQLite DB creation under app documents), and doc_builder_skill.dart:99 (slugified PDF name)."
