          "message": {
            "text": "Path traversal via model-controlled output filename in the PDF export tool — Ruled out: lib/data/datasources/skills/doc_builder_skill.dart:75-108 (export_document_pdf write path)\n\n`export_document_pdf` is Tier 1 auto (doc_builder_skill.dart:62) and takes `outputFileName`/`title` from model output, so the write path is reachable without HITL — but traversal cannot survive `_slugify` (:125-132): every character outside [a-z0-9] (including '/', '\\\\', '.') is replaced with '_', leading/trailing '_' stripped, length capped at 60, and empty results become 'document'. The resulting name is joined into `<documents>/documents/doc_<slug>_<timestamp>.pdf` (:97). No `..` sequence can be produced by the transform, so the write is contained to the app documents dir."
