            "text": "Runtime confirmation of the readable path set (same-UID access to app-private databases) — Requires further review: Dynamic validation of read_device_file against app-private storage (databases/flames_memory.db, flames_skills.db)\n\nNo Android build was possible (no emulator, no adb, no running app, no resolved Dart dependencies), so I could not confirm by execution which absolute paths the app process can actually open at runtime, nor observe a real model-emitted tool call reaching the sink. Android semantics make same-UID reads of the app's own private storage the expected behaviour, but that was not observed. The report (vuln-0007) is filed at confidence=medium with this gap named in confidence_rationale, and it is carried as an open item."
