            "text": "Plaintext secrets at rest (OTP persisted in chat history) — Ruled out: lib/data/datasources/local/chat/chat_local_datasource.dart (saveMessages / FlutterSecureStorage backend)\n\nRuled out as a separate plaintext-at-rest finding: agent_cubit.dart:826 -> chat_local_datasource.dart:113-121 _storage.write(...) where _storage is FlutterSecureStorage 9.2.4 (pubspec.lock:544-551; lib/common/injection/modules.dart:23), i.e. EncryptedSharedPreferences. The chat-history copy of the OTP is therefore encrypted at rest and is not claimed as an exposure. The separate memory-vault path (save_memory Tier-1 -> flames_memory.db, plain SQLite) is referenced only as a supporting sentence in vuln-0008 impact because a sibling agent owns memory-vault findings."
