          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/alternative-configuration-write-routes-manual-paste-add-profile-form-intent-extras-share-target-gateway-rpc-with-weaker-destination-validation",
          "ruleIndex": 115,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Alternative configuration-write routes (manual paste, Add-Profile form, intent extras, share target, gateway RPC) with weaker destination validation — Ruled out: Non-QR routes to the base-URL/key write primitive\n\nNo alternative route sets a destination with weaker validation, and none can pair a new URL with an old key. Manual JSON paste funnels into the same `_handleBarcode` (qr_scanner_screen.dart:170-258, submit at :250) so it inherits the identical parse+persist path. The Add-Profile form (add_profile_screen.dart:411-425) requires URL and token in the same submit and passes `makeActive: false`, so its new profile is not synced to the active settings unless it becomes the first profile or is later activated — and activation always syncs both fields (`setActiveServerProfile` secure_storage_service.dart:281-288). `MainActivity.extractActionFromIntent` (MainActivity.kt:73-85) reads only `extra_flames_action`; the value reaches a fixed three-string switch (voice_turn_action_listener.dart:162-178) with no default branch, so no intent extra can reach `saveBaseUrl`/`saveApiKey` (grep: no `getStringExtra` other than action/title/content in the whole Kotlin tree). The share path (share_target_cubit.dart:42-48, share_target_service.dart:95-118) only maps shared content into a chat prompt. Gateway RPC frames (gateway_rpc_receiver.dart:68-176) dispatch only to `toolRegistry.executeTool`, and no registered tool writes base URL or key (repo-wide grep for `saveBaseUrl|saveApiKey|saveSettings` over lib/domain + lib/data/datasources/tools is empty)."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Non-QR routes to the base-URL/key write primitive"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
