            "text": "Server-driven credential re-pointing on reconnect / redirect frame — Ruled out: lib/data/datasources/remote/gateway/gateway_client.dart _triggerReconnect + lib/domain/entities/gateway/gateway_message.dart frame inventory\n\nReconnect reuses the locally stored URL/token: `_triggerReconnect` (gateway_client.dart:376-380) calls `connect(_currentGatewayUrl!, token: _currentToken)` from local fields; no frame type in `lib/domain/entities/gateway/gateway_message.dart:16-81` carries a URL, host, or profile change (only auth/auth_success/auth_failure/ping/pong/text_delta/tool_call_request/tool_call_response/tool_event/elicitation_request/elicitation_response/chat_message/tool_manifest/error/chat_cancel/raw), and `GatewayRawMessage` (:422-435) is never re-sent by the client (`sendJson` is only called with locally-constructed messages at :386). No server-driven re-pointing exists."
