        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/other-credential-in-transit-shapes-query-string-tokens-credentials-in-logcat-tls-verification-weakening",
          "ruleIndex": 127,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Other credential-in-transit shapes: query-string tokens, credentials in logcat, TLS verification weakening — No issue identified: Whole-app transit sweep (lib/ + android/app/src/main/kotlin/)\n\nSwept for other credential-in-transit shapes. (a) Query-string credentials: grep across lib/ for `?token=`, `?api_key=`, `api_key=`, `access_token` returns ZERO hits — every credential is carried in a header (`Authorization: Bearer`, chat_datasource.dart:51, voice_output_service.dart:258, server_profile_probe_service_impl.dart:23/70) or in the WebSocket auth frame (gateway_client.dart:212-216), never in a URL. This matters because a query-string token would additionally land in server logs and referrers. (b) Logcat: grep for `Log.`, `println`, `printStackTrace`, `System.out` across android/app/src/main/kotlin/ returns zero hits, so no Kotlin component writes a credential to logcat; the Dart-side log sites are covered by the parent's entry 1689c2. (c) TLS verification: no `badCertificateCallback`, `onBadCertificate`, `setTrustedCertificates`, `SecurityContext`, `HttpOverrides` or custom `HttpClientAdapter` anywhere in lib/ or android/ (only a `DioExceptionType.badCertificate` case in failure_message.dart:68), so https/wss requests use the platform trust store unweakened. (d) Full enumeration of `Bearer`/`Authorization` in lib/ + android/ returns exactly four sites, all accounted for above — no fifth credential sink."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Whole-app transit sweep (lib/ + android/app/src/main/kotlin/)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "strix": {
              "coverage_outcome": "no_issue_found",
              "risk_area": "Other credential-in-transit shapes: query-string tokens, credentials in logcat, TLS verification weakening",
              "surface": "Whole-app transit sweep (lib/ + android/app/src/main/kotlin/)",
              "recorded_by": "Cleartext Credential Transport Validator",
              "source": "agent_reported"
            }
