            "text": "Escalation of the app-private file write to code execution — Ruled out: Arbitrary app-private file write → code execution escalation (dex/so/native loading)\n\nNo code path executes or dynamically loads anything from a writable app-private directory: grep of lib/ and android/app/src/main/kotlin/ for Process.start, Runtime.getRuntime, DexClassLoader, System.load, DynamicLibrary.open and dart:ffi returns zero matches. Artifacts under databases/, shared_prefs/ and app_flutter/ (Hive) are opened as data only. The impact of the traversal is therefore data integrity, not code execution - stated explicitly in the filed report so the severity is not over-rated."
