          "message": {
            "text": "Cross-app reachability of Flutter platform channels / deep links — Ruled out: Flutter MethodChannel / EventChannel surface (all channels in MainActivity.kt and plugins)\n\nAll MethodChannel/EventChannel names in the app are in-process Flutter binary-messenger channels (MainActivity.kt:31-39 defines nine, plus the plugin's receive_sharing_intent/messages and events-media). They are reachable only from the app's own Dart code; a third-party Android app has no handle on the binary messenger and cannot invoke a channel handler directly. The only way a foreign app can influence them is by starting an exported component, which is exactly the three validated paths already filed (vuln-0003/0011/0014). No getInitialLink / uni_links / app_links deep-link plugin is present in pubspec.yaml; the only deep-link-shaped surface is the manifest VIEW content:// filter, covered under the traversal and share findings."
          },
